{
  "name": "Marketing KPI Monitoring & Data Quality Alert",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "5d2f9590-b647-4744-a065-a62bc466ec95",
      "name": "Daily 08:00 Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT check_name, check_category, metric_value, comparison,\n       threshold_value, status, message\nFROM vw_monitoring_checks\nORDER BY status, check_category, check_name;",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f19b852e-f6f1-4525-935e-ede22161be29",
      "name": "Run Monitoring Checks",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.mySql",
      "typeVersion": 2.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "insert",
        "table": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "monitoring_log",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "dataMode": "autoMapInputData",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "65a17faa-7861-4736-9d2b-0c3f5b86af0d",
      "name": "Log Check Results",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.mySql",
      "typeVersion": 2.4,
      "position": [
        500,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "03fea218-cc61-467f-b21b-c94d8c9fea27",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "ALERT",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d524edf9-64a5-4ea0-b007-b212977c0240",
      "name": "Any Alerts?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        500,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Combine every ALERT item into ONE notification (not one message per check).\nconst alerts = $input.all().map(item => item.json);\n\nconst lines = alerts.map(a =>\n  `- [${a.check_category}] ${a.check_name}: ${a.metric_value} (alert if ${a.comparison} ${a.threshold_value})`\n);\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    subject: `Marketing BI monitoring: ${alerts.length} check(s) need attention`,\n    body: [\n      'Marketing Intelligence & Campaign Operations - automated KPI / data-quality check',\n      `Run time (UTC): ${new Date().toISOString()}`,\n      '',\n      ...lines,\n      '',\n      'Source: marketing_intelligence.vw_monitoring_checks (MySQL).',\n      'Portfolio demonstration - not connected to a live production environment.'\n    ].join('\\n'),\n    alert_count: alerts.length,\n    alert_checks: alerts.map(a => a.check_name)\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "860512d6-66e2-4cfa-944f-d140192bd78a",
      "name": "Build Alert Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        760,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "9fe92bd1-789d-474e-a27a-5d58131f9edc",
      "name": "Send Notification (placeholder)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1000,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "d7ba0855-7a05-4148-abd1-e57f65e894d0",
      "name": "No Alert - All Checks OK",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        760,
        540
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Marketing KPI Monitoring & Data Quality Alert\nPortfolio demonstration of automated BI monitoring. **Not connected to a live company production environment.**\n\n1. Schedule runs daily 08:00\n2. MySQL reads `vw_monitoring_checks` (9 KPI / DQ checks, thresholds in `monitoring_thresholds`)\n3. Every result is logged to `monitoring_log`\n4. ALERT rows are combined into one message\n5. Notification is a placeholder - swap for Gmail / Outlook / Slack / Send Email node\n\nThe MySQL node has pinned sample data (real output of the view) so the flow can be tested without a database. Unpin it to query live.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "4c2f4ed5-438d-45a3-94ed-65338c2cce39",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -120
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Daily 08:00 Schedule": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Run Monitoring Checks",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Run Monitoring Checks": {
